              <section class="content">
                <p>本頁包含 Flutter 3.44 的發行說明。</p>
                <div class="header-wrapper">
                  <h2 id="本版本的變更內容">本版本的變更內容</h2>
                  <a class="heading-link" href="#本版本的變更內容" aria-label="Link to '本版本的變更內容' section">#</a>
                </div>
                <div class="header-wrapper">
                  <h3 id="framework">Framework</h3>
                  <a class="heading-link" href="#framework" aria-label="Link to 'Framework' section">#</a>
                </div>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    Add new motion accessibility features to iOS. by @ksokolovskyi in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/178102">178102</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Implementation of tooltip windows for win32 by @mattkae in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/179147">179147</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an EditableText doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180457">180457</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Merge <code>widget_tester_leaks_free_test.dart</code> into <code>widget_tester_test.dart</code> by @dkwingsmt in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180600">180600</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a Container doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180350">180350</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an Expansible doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180478">180478</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a CupertinoTabScaffold doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/179824">179824</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a FlutterLogo doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180617">180617</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a LongPressDraggable doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180408">180408</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Migrate doc and code to use sendAnnounce by @chunhtai in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180776">180776</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add API sample and docs for Expansible widget by @gowsikraja in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180273">180273</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix RawAutocomplete unmounted crash during async optionsBuilder by @augustocesarperin in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180824">180824</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Manually roll test dependencies by @goderbauer in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180886">180886</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a DisplayFeatureSubScreen doesn't crash in 0x0 environ… by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180357">180357</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a DragTarget doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180422">180422</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a FormField doesn't crash at 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180810">180810</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a Banner doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180254">180254</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an ErrorWidget doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180830">180830</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a FocusScope doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180715">180715</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add Flutter as a Swift Package dependency by @vashworth in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/178931">178931</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Update link to FlutterTest font generation script by @lsaudon in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/179957">179957</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add RouteSettings to showCupertinoSheet by @jonmountjoy in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/178643">178643</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Implement superellipse support for CupertinoFocusHalo by @O-Hannonen in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180724">180724</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Manual roll of pub packages including an update to meta version 1.18.0 by @jason-simmons in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181078">181078</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    fix(windows): use wcsnlen for defensive programming (CWE-126) by @dbebawy in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180419">180419</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove divider from widgets tests by @navaronbracke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180999">180999</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove MaterialButtons and Divider from draggable_scrollable_sheet_test.dart by @navaronbracke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180996">180996</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    remove unused divider by @navaronbracke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180990">180990</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    use null-aware element in <code>pointer_signal_resolver.0.dart‎</code> by @AbdeMohlbi in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180981">180981</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix test cross-imports for ListTile  by @huycozy in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180572">180572</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Enhance Hero widget with customizable animation curves by @aaazlkm in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180100">180100</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Improve the algorithm for rounded superellipse paths to work better at very large ratio by @dkwingsmt in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180453">180453</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an AnimatedSwitcher doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180190">180190</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a Form doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180792">180792</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add RenderSliver.getMaxPaintRect by @zemanux in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180074">180074</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a Focus doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180674">180674</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add RawTooltipl example and test by @AbdeMohlbi in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180722">180722</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [Android] Add display corner radii support. by @ksokolovskyi in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/179219">179219</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a GridPaper doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180906">180906</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an Icon doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181021">181021</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    fix description for semantics finders by @navaronbracke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181214">181214</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Use null-aware elements in cupertino/nav_bar.dart by @brahim-guaali in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181237">181237</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix remove material import textfield by @kazbeksultanov in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181254">181254</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that a Hero doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180954">180954</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add ExpansibleController.toggle method. by @ksokolovskyi in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181320">181320</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix leaks in <code>flutter_test</code> tests by @dkwingsmt in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180879">180879</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make topGap not required for CupertinoSheetTransition by @MitchellGoodwin in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181269">181269</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove unnecessary Material import from sliver_visibility_test by @kazbeksultanov in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181248">181248</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove unnecessary Material import from dialog_test.dart by @kazbeksultanov in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181249">181249</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    CupertinoSheetRoute with scrolling and dragging by @MitchellGoodwin in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/177337">177337</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fixes duplicated import in accessibility test library by @chunhtai in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181506">181506</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an AnimatedContainer doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181198">181198</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an AnimatedPositionedDirectional doesn't crash in 0x0 … by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181451">181451</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an AnimatedRotation doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181486">181486</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an ImageIcon doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181099">181099</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an AnimatedAlign doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181361">181361</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix remove material import box decoration test by @kazbeksultanov in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181253">181253</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an ImageFiltered doesn't crash at 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181067">181067</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an AnimatedPadding doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181235">181235</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    test: Clarify failure messages on gestures/debug_test.dart by @luanpotter in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181109">181109</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    feat: add onEnd to AnimatedCrossFade by @rkishan516 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181455">181455</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    [web] Use defensive null check in text editing placeElement by @flutter-zl in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180795">180795</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Add TestWidgetsApp utility and refactor widget tests to use WidgetsApp by @rkishan516 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180456">180456</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Enhance error handling of WidgetsBindingObserver callbacks by @kazbeksultanov in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181174">181174</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix P3-to-sRGB color conversion to operate in linear light by @westito in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181720">181720</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Use null-aware spread in cupertino/app.dart by @brahim-guaali in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181585">181585</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Use null-aware elements in cupertino/list_tile.dart by @brahim-guaali in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181243">181243</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Fix DecoratedSliver sample to avoid antialiasing gap by @brahim-guaali in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/179848">179848</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove material from basic_test.dart by @navaronbracke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181444">181444</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove material from sliver_tree_test.dart by @navaronbracke in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181415">181415</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    feature: implementation of tooltips in the <code>_TestWindowingOwner</code> and minor bugfixes to the multiple windows example app by @mattkae in 
                    <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181510">181510</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove unnecessary Material import from cupertino/slider_test.dart by @nathannewyen in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180957">180957</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Remove Material library dependency from expansible_test.dart by @Erengun in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181657">181657</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>Fix decorated box by @zemanux in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/179802">179802</a></li>
                  <li>
                    Make sure that an AnimatedScale doesn't crash in 0x0 environment by @ahmedsameha1 in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181481">181481</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
