                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Constrain RawAutocomplete options by soft keyboard by @victorsanni in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/181930">181930</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    macOS: Implement tooltip window controller by @knopp in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/180895">180895</a>
                  </li>
